OL,3,AThe island where locals say data
OL,4,Acentres are taking their water
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Water! Water!" the crowd shouted as it
OL,7,Fstormed a compound with data centres,
OL,8,Farmed with empty plastic bottles and
OL,9,Fjerry cans.
OL,11,FThere were about 300 of them, all
OL,12,Fresidents on the Indonesian island of
OL,13,FBatam, and they were furious that the
OL,14,Ftaps at home had run dry, while the
OL,15,Fdata centres in the new Nongsa Digital
OL,16,FPark seemed to have enough water to
OL,17,Fprotect their machines from
OL,18,Foverheating.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
