OL,3,AThe island where locals say data
OL,4,Acentres are taking their water
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Not a single drop has come through our
OL,7,Ftaps for the last three months... Our
OL,8,Fwater supply had been reliable until
OL,9,Fthe data centres came," Dewi Susanti,
OL,10,Fone of the protesters, told the BBC.
OL,12,FPeople in her village, Bakau Serip,
OL,13,Fwere now depending on tanker trucks
OL,14,Fthat dispensed "dirty, cloudy and
OL,15,Fsmelly" water, she said.
